    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden invasion of space aliens hunting for human biological waste, the job of a sewage truck operator has become a perilous craft. Join the elite of the elite and become a transporter of the brown gold \u2014 the very substance without which the world wouldn\u2019t be quite so... picturesque. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.poster.avif?t=1749640408\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.webm?t=1749640408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/d9566175592ba890807223413e68aae5.mp4?t=1749640408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But beware: dark alleys hide sinister surprises, and no matter how hard you try, you\u2019ll never be fully prepared for what lurks there. It\u2019s not just aliens after you \u2014 sludge demons spawned from the filth and the fanatical followers of the Brown Cult, whose ominous leader is rumored to have ties to a shadowy global government, are on your tail too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.poster.avif?t=1749640408\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.webm?t=1749640408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430600/extras/f0d5c3f558825c9b8ea9def30c898391.mp4?t=1749640408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and upgrade your ZIL truck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the stench-filled atmosphere of terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks for the district administrator and the sewage treatment plant director.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the open world, no matter how foul it smells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help locals dispose of hazardous waste and reduce environmental pollution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the aliens and expose the conspiracy of the secret global government.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca9 Welcome to the ride of your life \u2014 and what a smelly one it will be!</p>",
